            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "NOTE 3 The EVID can be any unique identifier number or string. For electric bus applications it can comprise a readable name or, e.g. the EV number plate. For any other application it can be any random number which is unique at that time, thus privacy is not concerned.",
