        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The pairing and positioning device provides a spatial selective orthogonal communication channel to the WLAN communication when the EV is in close proximity to the ACDP in order to resolve the undetermined association of the EV communication to the ACDP's EVSE. The PPD consists of a marker located on the EV and a receiver located in the ACDP infrastructure.",
